                    need_asset:             `A reusable asset — give HR a scalable, repeatable programme to own`,
                    need_everything:        `All three at once — satisfy the sponsor, the MDs and HR in one design`,
                    buyer_sponsor:          `The CHRO sponsor — owns the business outcome and signs the renewal`,
                    buyer_divmds:           `The divisional MDs — they hold the technical budgets`,
                    buyer_hr:               `HR / L&D — they run the procurement process`,
                    buyer_everyone:         `Everyone equally — keep all stakeholders happy`,
                    aud_segmented:          `Two populations — general-management leaders and technical/divisional leaders, designed differently`,
                    aud_one:                `One uniform population — same programme for all 120`,
                    aud_ignore:             `Don't map yet — decide once the agenda is drafted`,

