                    r2_outcome_label:       `When the cost still exceeds £1.8m, how do you close the gap?`,
                    fmt_hybrid:             `Hybrid — a custom NorthGrid spine plus modular open components for generic skills`,
                    fmt_custom:             `Fully bespoke custom — maximum fit, the £2.6m design`,
                    fmt_open:               `Mostly open — route learners through existing open programmes to save cost`,
